  id: rave
  title: 8. Maximum Permitted Joy
  region: The Unincorporated Frequency
  briefing: Hold the generator compound through three security waves while Nova broadcasts
    the cooling-grid documents. Stay inside the gold perimeter to keep the uplink
    transmitting.
  opening: 'Nova: The permit allows amplified sound until ten. Their cease-and-desist
    drone arrived at nine fifty-eight. I have prepared an extremely short set.'
  midpoint: 'Nova: Uplink is live. These kicks are original, by the way. The explosions
    are audience participation.'
  closing: 'Nova: The records are public. The neighbors asked us to turn down the
    security vehicles. Fair criticism.'
  optionalObjective: Cause 20 pieces of collateral damage
